Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:08:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis: home page: a date on every
 card and headline; the map marks news from the last day and week with counts;
 the Algarve grid capped at nine with 'All 17 towns'; the header buttons wrap;
 the Design pill is a small mark

For Dinis's feedback of 26 Nov (relayed by cl-6.maestro). The pill and header are in assets/design/design.css and assets/top/top.css (shared with designer@).
A date beside an article's slug in desks/correspondent/front-page.json (lead, top) wins over the article's own, so the iOS app JSON can carry it.

